# skills: Dread Roar (fear on every enemy, each with its own roll). The random state is set to 24 (roll 3)
# every time the effect hook site runs, so every roll lands. Gabryel alone at level 39 (level index 38 pinned, battle MP pinned to 50), first temple battle
# (back row 4, 5, 6; front row 9, 10). On the Special list Down, Right, Right reaches the skill (in Howl's place) (shot
# dr_list); A casts with no picker: her pose, then a green ring on each enemy (shots dr_a to
# dr_i), MP 50 -> 37 once, and every enemy's status goes 0 -> 4. Next round A on it is refused with "No
# effect!" (dr_refused): every enemy has a status. Battle records at 0x0228E860 (0x6C each: status in the low nibble of +0x08, HP +0x14, MP +0x18).
# Run with --save.
include party_gabryel
pin u32 0x020B471C 38
pinptr u32 0x020B8620 0x18 50
execpoke 0x020503A0 u32 0x020A0238 24
wait 270
peek u32 0x020B8620 records
watch u32 0x0228e878 gabryel_mp
watch u8 0x0228ea18 status4
watch u8 0x0228ea84 status5
watch u8 0x0228eaf0 status6
watch u8 0x0228ebc8 status8
watch u8 0x0228ec34 status9
watch u8 0x0228eca0 status10
press A 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press Down 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
shot dr_list
press A 8
wait 30
wait 210
wait 30
shot dr_a
wait 30
shot dr_b
wait 30
shot dr_c
wait 30
shot dr_d
wait 30
shot dr_e
wait 30
shot dr_f
wait 30
shot dr_g
wait 30
shot dr_h
wait 30
shot dr_i
waituntil u32 0x020B0010 7 3000
wait 110
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press Down 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 30
shot dr_refused
wait 100
shot dr_after
